    {
      "id": "s2",
      "part": 2,
      "label": "Part 2",
      "instruction": "Look at the pictures and talk about them with your partner. Then answer the examiner’s questions.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q2",
          "number": 2,
          "points": 15,
          "skills": [],
          "material": [
            {
              "id": "i1",
              "type": "imageRef",
              "image": "img1"
            }
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "speaking",
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Look at the pictures of different outdoor activities. Talk about them with your partner: say if you like them and why or why not. Then answer the examiner’s questions."
              }
            ],
            "turns": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "text": "Here are some pictures that show different outdoor activities. Do you like these different outdoor activities? Say why or why not.",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t1.mp3",
                  "seconds": 9.4
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t10",
                "text": "I love having a barbecue with my family. It's really fun. Do you like barbecues?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t10.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.4
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t11",
                "text": "Climbing a mountain looks hard. I get tired very quickly. What do you think?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t11.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.4
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t12",
                "text": "Swimming in a lake is nice in summer, but the water is cold! Would you like to do that?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t12.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.7
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t13",
                "text": "I like walking in the forest because it's quiet. Do you like forests?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t13.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t2",
                "text": "Do you think swimming in a lake is a good idea? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t2.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.9
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t3",
                "text": "Do you think climbing a mountain is hard? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t3.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.5
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t4",
                "text": "Do you think spending time in a forest is interesting? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t4.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.6
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t5",
                "text": "Do you think having a barbecue at home is great? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t5.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.4
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t6",
                "text": "Do you think running in a city is healthy? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t6.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.4
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t7",
                "text": "So, which of these outdoor activities do you like best?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t7.mp3",
                  "seconds": 4.2
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t8",
                "text": "Now, do you prefer doing activities indoors or outdoors when you have free time? Why?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t8.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t9",
                "text": "When is the best time for you to do outdoor activities? Why?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket1/ket1-t2-s-q2-t9.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.4
                }
              }
            ],
            "maxSeconds": 45,
            "scoring": "judge"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
